{
  "name": "Summarise a YouTube channel's new uploads with AI every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Summarise a channel's new uploads every morning\n\n### How it works\n\nEvery morning this reads the latest uploads from a YouTube channel, takes the newest three, pulls each video's transcript, and has an LLM write a short summary of what the video actually teaches.\n\nThe summary is written to a Google Sheet keyed on the video ID, and posted to Slack. The model reads the transcript text the Actor already extracted, so it never touches the video and the whole thing costs a fraction of a video-understanding call.\n\nPoint it at a competitor to see what they are publishing, or at your own channel to generate descriptions and show notes.\n\n### The sheet\n\n`videoId` is the key the upsert matches on, so a re-run never writes the same video twice.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Install `n8n-nodes-youtube-scraper-apify` from **Settings \u2192 Community nodes**.\n2. Add an **Apify API** credential \u2014 free account at [apify.com](https://apify.com?fpr=bucho&fp_sid=n8n). On n8n Cloud you can use **OAuth2** instead and skip the token.\n3. Connect Google Sheets, Slack and an OpenAI key.\n4. Point the Sheets node at your spreadsheet and pick a Slack channel.\n5. Run once by hand, check the sheet, then enable the schedule.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 880
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1180,
        -220
      ],
      "id": "501cky00-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Newest three only\n\nThe channel returns uploads newest first, so a plain limit is enough. Raise it and you pay for a transcript per video.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        -220
      ],
      "id": "511cky00-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Transcript in, summary out\n\nThe transcript arrives as plain text on `text`, which is exactly what the model needs. No audio, no video, no vision model.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        20,
        -220
      ],
      "id": "521cky00-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -640,
        320
      ],
      "id": "e1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every morning at 8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
